# ============================================================
# .gitignore — USAGE-ONLY repo.
# Committed: everything needed to BUILD the image and RUN the app
# (the app package incl. committed instruction crops + static assets,
# the content model, the audio files, and the Docker config).
# Ignored: regeneration-only tooling + source PDFs + scratch + secrets.
# ============================================================

# --- Python / env ---
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# --- IDE / tooling ---
.vscode/
.kiro/

# --- Secrets / personal setup (templates .example are committed) ---
.env
dev/.env
docker/.env
docker/docker-compose.override.yml

# --- Runtime data ---
data/db/

# ============================================================
# Regeneration-only + source + scratch (NOT needed to run the app).
# The app ships pre-cropped images in app/static/instructions/ and the
# assembled content/logbook.de.final.json, so none of the below is needed
# by end users. (Keep them locally; they're just not committed.)
# ============================================================

# Out-of-band content pipeline (scripts, overrides, source corpus).
dev/

# All source PDFs / renders / scratch under data/ EXCEPT the audio files,
# which the app serves at runtime (bind-mounted). Ignore everything under data/
# recursively, then re-include the audiofiles directory.
/data/**
!/data/audiofiles/
!/data/audiofiles/**
